    "sections": {
        "description": "Glass Artifact is a beautifully crafted, SEO-first WordPress theme built for artisans, glassmakers, interior designers, and creative professionals wanting to grow online. Image galleries, client testimonials, and service highlights allow you to show off craftsmanship clearly. Clean code, mobile-friendly layouts, and fast page speeds help your site rank for “glass studio WordPress theme” and “artisan portfolio template.” The theme is translation-ready and supports advanced customization, including color schemes and layout variations. CTAs guide visitors toward commissions or product purchases, while schema integration makes it easy to appear in relevant Google searches. Well-placed navigation ensures every visitor enjoys exploring your work. Glass Artifact combines artistic presentation with technical SEO for a professional website that inspires trust and drives new business."
    },
